                                                "sense_id": "077af3dd-3579-3542-b64b-d98f732f5c03",
                                                "text": "The wife stumbled into the water, and as soon as her loot was wet, she immediately resumed her old shape as a beaver, her son became a beaverling, and the brooklet, changing to a roaring river, bore them to the lake."
                                            }
                                        ]
