                                                "sense_id": "4761fc77-57df-3551-af49-c8256d69ab23",
                                                "text": "The Argentina fan who risked jail by getting her kit off at the World Cup final has broken her silence by posting more topless videos."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c709479f-d6c6-3cb8-9336-834dcd0fa1af",
                                        "entry_id": "ffd2931b-8952-3842-92e6-eb608bcab255",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A full software distribution, as opposed to a patch or upgrade."
